<main>
<h1>Conceptual models and executable specifications</h1>
<p class="meta">morphir-ukvn.7 · Design draft 0.12 · Packages and namespace scopes</p>
<p><strong>Read the summaries first.</strong> Expand the reference panels for the complete specification. Examples and open decisions are called out separately.</p>
<nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents"><details><summary>Browse all 17 sections</summary><ul>
<li><a href="#intent">At a glance</a></li>
<li><a href="#decisions">Decided, proposed, still open</a></li>
<li><a href="#language">Read the language</a></li>
<li><a href="#smithy">Smithy coverage</a></li>
<li><a href="#self-specification">Morphir specifies itself</a></li>
<li><a href="#contracts">What a check means</a></li>
<li><a href="#delivery">First delivery</a></li>
