<tr><td><strong>DECIDED</strong></td><td>Multiline text strings are required, with MoonBit's approach as the preferred inspiration.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>DECIDED</strong></td><td>Represent the capabilities of Smithy contract traits, RPC v2 JSON, RPC v2 CBOR and AI traits.</td></tr>
