<desc id="intent-flow-description">Intent is refined into requirements, concepts and contracts, then implementation. Checks produce evidence before and after implementation; evidence can revise the original intent.</desc>
<g fill="var(--code-bg)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5">
