<section id="intent">
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<p>A Morphir model should carry intent, types, contracts and evidence from an early idea to a delivered application.</p>
<div role="figure" aria-labelledby="intent-flow-title">
<svg viewBox="0 0 520 330" width="100%" style="display: block; max-width: 36rem; height: auto; margin: 0 auto;" role="img" aria-labelledby="intent-flow-title intent-flow-description">
<title id="intent-flow-title">The arrow of intent and evidence feedback</title>
