<details data-reference="decisions-0"><summary>Decision rationale and first-delivery boundaries</summary>
<table><thead><tr><th>Decision for review</th><th>Reason and consequence</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>ConceptualModel is a versioned profile of a Morphir model.</td><td>It can mix prose-only concepts, resolved signatures and implementations. Keep existing distribution variants as IR projections while terminology develops.</td></tr>
