<p>Rejected as first-delivery defaults: inventing a second model container; changing every Library/Application wire tag; requiring Smithy service shapes to represent functional modules; interpreting arbitrary prose automatically as executable logic; implementing an SMT solver, general theorem prover, full temporal logic or entire financial regulation; and making Workbench or remote services prerequisites for the portable core.</p>
</details>
