>{&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Hello, Morphir&quot;}</td></tr><tr><td>append-unicode</td><td>{&quot;text&quot;: &quot;a😀é&quot;}</td></tr><tr><td>equal-normalization</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: false}</td></tr><tr><td>equal-emoji</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>length-utf16</td><td>{&quot;int&quot;: &quot;4&quot;}</td></tr><tr><td>sdk-lexical-order</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: false}</td></tr><tr><td>source-shortlex-order</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>source-shortlex-unicode</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>sdk-surrogate-half</td><td>{&quot;units&quot;: [&quot;55357&quot;]}</td></tr><tr><td>sdk-negative-offset</td><td>{&quot;text&quot;: &quot;&quot;}</td></tr><tr><td>is-empty</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>contains-emoji</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>prefix</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr><tr><td>suffix</td><td>{&quot;bool&quot;: true}</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section><section id="review"><h2>Decisions to review before implementation</h2><ol><li>Use String/Bool basics first, with a real MoonBit greeting workbench sample, and separate additive qualified profiles for later operation subsets.</li><li>Keep well-formed UTF-16 as the source invariant, with executable entry guards and a separately classified source-runtime extension instead of treating metadata or raw Text as sufficient.</li><li>Preserve shortlex ordering and clamped, surrogate-trimmed owned slices; initially admit only the four named predicate methods through the shared resolver. Defer case conversion and other unqualified String methods.</li><li>Use a 1,048,576-unit per-value hard bound, with hosts allowed to tighten it and append checked before allocation.</li></ol><p>Task <code>morphir-ukvn.1.10.13.1</code> explicitly requires semantic review before dependent implementation. Scheduling approval is already recorded. After review, refine the existing implementation beads and continue with the shared typed foundation and String basics; do not create duplicate tasks or mark source support complete from these probes.</p></section>
